              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Leō in amphitheātrō mānsuētus est. The lion in the amphitheatre is tame."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The participle of mānsuēscō: manus 'hand' + suēscō 'to get used to' — used to the hand."
            }
